<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Limited flight that allows this colonist to hop and glide small distances over terrain. They will ignore terrain movement costs when moving.-->
  <VREInsector_Hover.description>背后的翅膀使此人能以更快的速度移动，且不会受到地形带来的移动速度惩罚。</VREInsector_Hover.description>
  <!--EN: glide-->
  <VREInsector_Hover.label>滑翔</VREInsector_Hover.label>
  <!--EN: After being ready to do a chestburst implantation, the person with the chestburst pregnancy gene goes through a short period of sterility till they are capable of producing another. This is only a temporary condition and causes no long term effects.-->
  <VREInsector_TempSterile.description>在准备好进行破胸胎儿植入后，此人会暂时陷入无法生育的疲劳期，需要一定的时间来恢复。不会造成长期伤害。</VREInsector_TempSterile.description>
  <!--EN: chestburst implantation fatigue-->
  <VREInsector_TempSterile.label>不育疲劳期</VREInsector_TempSterile.label>
  <!--EN: This person has a highly concentrated toxin in their blood. When bleeding, they emit large amounts of tox gas, and upon death, their gear will be destroyed by acid.-->
  <VRE_AcidBlood.description>这种基因的携带者血液中蕴含剧毒。当他们流血时会释放大量毒气，且死亡后会像质溶器一样溶解与身体接触的装备。</VRE_AcidBlood.description>
  <!--EN: acid blood-->
  <VRE_AcidBlood.label>酸毒血液</VRE_AcidBlood.label>
  <!--EN: When a colonist with chestburst pregnancy gene becomes pregnant, they need to designate another willing or unwilling individual to implant the fetus. Once the fetus matures, it will burst out of the ribcage of the victim, killing the host. If they don’t do it before the second trimester begins (6 days), the pregnancy will be terminated.-->
  <VRE_ChestburstPregnancyHediff.description>此人在拥有“破胸妊娠”基因的情况下怀孕，需要将胎儿植入其他生物体内。当胎儿发育完全后，便会从胸口处破体而出，被植入者将在痛苦中死去。如果胎儿长时间未被植入（6天），则此状态会自动终止。</VRE_ChestburstPregnancyHediff.description>
  <!--EN: chestburst pregnancy needs implantation-->
  <VRE_ChestburstPregnancyHediff.label>破胸胎儿（待植入）</VRE_ChestburstPregnancyHediff.label>
  <!--EN: Affected by a chestburst pregnancy. If the implantation advances to severity 1, or if the creature dies when it is sufficiently advanced (more than 90%), the fetus will devour the victim from inside and hatch from its corpse. Gestation time is 15 days.-->
  <VRE_ChestburstPregnancy_Victim.description>此单位体内已被植入了破胸胎儿。如果胎儿的妊娠进度达到100%，或此单位在妊娠进度达到90%以上时死亡，胎儿便会从胸口处破体而出。胎儿发育完全需要15天。</VRE_ChestburstPregnancy_Victim.description>
  <!--EN: chestburst pregnancy-->
  <VRE_ChestburstPregnancy_Victim.label>破胸胎儿</VRE_ChestburstPregnancy_Victim.label>
  <!--EN: egg-->
  <VRE_ChestburstPregnancy_Victim.stages.0.label>卵</VRE_ChestburstPregnancy_Victim.stages.0.label>
  <!--EN: larva-->
  <VRE_ChestburstPregnancy_Victim.stages.1.label>成体</VRE_ChestburstPregnancy_Victim.stages.1.label>
  <!--EN: pupa-->
  <VRE_ChestburstPregnancy_Victim.stages.2.label>幼体</VRE_ChestburstPregnancy_Victim.stages.2.label>
  <!--EN: juvenile-->
  <VRE_ChestburstPregnancy_Victim.stages.3.label>结蛹</VRE_ChestburstPregnancy_Victim.stages.3.label>
  <!--EN: Affected by a chestburst pregnancy. If the implantation advances to severity 1, or if the creature dies when it is sufficiently advanced (more than 90%), the fetus will devour the victim from inside and hatch from its corpse. Gestation time is 15 days. This chestburst pregnancy is too advanced to remove surgically.-->
  <VRE_ChestburstPregnancy_Victim_Hidden.description>此单位体内已被植入了破胸胎儿。如果胎儿的妊娠进度达到100%，或此单位在妊娠进度达到90%以上时死亡，胎儿便会从胸口处破体而出。胎儿发育完全需要15天。\n\n由于已发育到中晚期阶段，破胸胎儿现在无法通过手术移除了。</VRE_ChestburstPregnancy_Victim_Hidden.description>
  <!--EN: chestburst pregnancy-->
  <VRE_ChestburstPregnancy_Victim_Hidden.label>破胸胎儿</VRE_ChestburstPregnancy_Victim_Hidden.label>
  <!--EN: egg-->
  <VRE_ChestburstPregnancy_Victim_Hidden.stages.0.label>卵</VRE_ChestburstPregnancy_Victim_Hidden.stages.0.label>
  <!--EN: larva-->
  <VRE_ChestburstPregnancy_Victim_Hidden.stages.1.label>成体</VRE_ChestburstPregnancy_Victim_Hidden.stages.1.label>
  <!--EN: pupa-->
  <VRE_ChestburstPregnancy_Victim_Hidden.stages.2.label>幼体</VRE_ChestburstPregnancy_Victim_Hidden.stages.2.label>
  <!--EN: juvenile-->
  <VRE_ChestburstPregnancy_Victim_Hidden.stages.3.label>结蛹</VRE_ChestburstPregnancy_Victim_Hidden.stages.3.label>
  <!--EN: This person has reduced activity and aggression and spend most of their time in a dormant state. Metabolism of such an individual is also reduced, allowing them to consume less nutrition to keep themselves alive.-->
  <VRE_Dormant.description>这种基因的携带者大部分时间都处于“蛰眠”状态。他们变得不再活跃和好斗，陷入精神崩溃时也必定为非暴力类型。他们的新陈代谢比正常人更慢，所需进食量也相应降低了。</VRE_Dormant.description>
  <!--EN: dormant-->
  <VRE_Dormant.label>蛰眠</VRE_Dormant.label>
  <!--EN: A generalized disruption to body functioning caused by excessive exposure to heat and sun. The victim can produce heat shock proteins in response to high temperatures, which will prevent them from dying but will make them require more nutrition. Recovery is quick once in a cool area.-->
  <VRE_HeatshockHediff.description>长时间暴露于高温和日晒的环境下导致的患者体内温度平衡失调状态。此时的患者会合成一种特殊的热休克蛋白，使其可以在最为酷热的环境中生存和活动，但所需进食量也相应增加了。热休克会在患者进入凉快的地方后随着时间的推移自然恢复。</VRE_HeatshockHediff.description>
  <!--EN: heatshock-->
  <VRE_HeatshockHediff.label>热休克</VRE_HeatshockHediff.label>
  <!--EN: initial-->
  <VRE_HeatshockHediff.stages.0.label>中等</VRE_HeatshockHediff.stages.0.label>
  <!--EN: initial-->
  <VRE_HeatshockHediff.stages.1.label>极重</VRE_HeatshockHediff.stages.1.label>
  <!--EN: minor-->
  <VRE_HeatshockHediff.stages.2.label>轻微</VRE_HeatshockHediff.stages.2.label>
  <!--EN: serious-->
  <VRE_HeatshockHediff.stages.3.label>较轻</VRE_HeatshockHediff.stages.3.label>
  <!--EN: extreme-->
  <VRE_HeatshockHediff.stages.4.label>严重</VRE_HeatshockHediff.stages.4.label>
  <!--EN: A generalized disruption to body functioning caused by excessive exposure to heat and sun. Celular damage and denaturation of proteins will cause burn damage and will very quickly cause loss of consciousness.-->
  <VRE_HeatstressHediff.description>长时间暴露于高温和日晒的环境下导致的患者体内温度平衡失调状态。这不仅会引起蛋白质变性、烧伤、疼痛以及严重恐火，还会降低意识和移动能力。</VRE_HeatstressHediff.description>
  <!--EN: heatstress-->
  <VRE_HeatstressHediff.label>热应激</VRE_HeatstressHediff.label>
  <!--EN: initial-->
  <VRE_HeatstressHediff.stages.0.label>中等</VRE_HeatstressHediff.stages.0.label>
  <!--EN: initial-->
  <VRE_HeatstressHediff.stages.1.label>极重</VRE_HeatstressHediff.stages.1.label>
  <!--EN: minor-->
  <VRE_HeatstressHediff.stages.2.label>轻微</VRE_HeatstressHediff.stages.2.label>
  <!--EN: serious-->
  <VRE_HeatstressHediff.stages.3.label>较轻</VRE_HeatstressHediff.stages.3.label>
  <!--EN: extreme-->
  <VRE_HeatstressHediff.stages.4.label>严重</VRE_HeatstressHediff.stages.4.label>
  <!--EN: megaspider horns-->
  <VRE_HornAttack.comps.0.tools.0.label>巨蜘蛛角</VRE_HornAttack.comps.0.tools.0.label>
  <!--EN: These horns can be used to maul enemies in combat if unarmed.-->
  <VRE_HornAttack.description>这对威武有力的角不仅可以小幅提高采矿速度，在手无寸铁时还能用来战斗。</VRE_HornAttack.description>
  <!--EN: megaspider horns-->
  <VRE_HornAttack.label>巨型蜘蛛角</VRE_HornAttack.label>
  <!--EN: This person will enter a hibernation if their temperatures drop below a certain point for too long. They will rapidly lose their body functions and fall into a deep sleep, which prevents any sort of frostbite damages but also makes them unable to do anything.-->
  <VRE_HypothermicHibernationHediff.description>此人因暴露于低温中而陷入了“低温冬眠”状态，其身体机能会逐渐丧失，直到完全沉睡。虽然能使此人不被冻伤，但也会失去行动能力。</VRE_HypothermicHibernationHediff.description>
  <!--EN: hypothermic hibernation-->
  <VRE_HypothermicHibernationHediff.label>低温冬眠</VRE_HypothermicHibernationHediff.label>
  <!--EN: shivering-->
  <VRE_HypothermicHibernationHediff.stages.0.label>沉睡</VRE_HypothermicHibernationHediff.stages.0.label>
  <!--EN: initial-->
  <VRE_HypothermicHibernationHediff.stages.1.label>倦乏</VRE_HypothermicHibernationHediff.stages.1.label>
  <!--EN: drowsy-->
  <VRE_HypothermicHibernationHediff.stages.2.label>较轻</VRE_HypothermicHibernationHediff.stages.2.label>
  <!--EN: sleep-->
  <VRE_HypothermicHibernationHediff.stages.3.label>轻微</VRE_HypothermicHibernationHediff.stages.3.label>
  <!--EN: deep sleep-->
  <VRE_HypothermicHibernationHediff.stages.4.label>昏睡</VRE_HypothermicHibernationHediff.stages.4.label>
  <!--EN: This person has a very inefficient acid in their midgut, making it harder to absorb nutrients. They will become hungry significantly faster, but they will be able to consume more.-->
  <VRE_InefficientMidgut.description>这种基因的携带者长有虚弱且低效的中肠，很难消化食物并吸收营养。他们比正常人饿的更快，但能吃下更多的食物。</VRE_InefficientMidgut.description>
  <!--EN: inefficient midgut-->
  <VRE_InefficientMidgut.label>虚弱中肠</VRE_InefficientMidgut.label>
  <!--EN: This person has a genetically-induced biochemical dependency on insect jelly. After 5 days without insect jelly, carriers will suffer from insect jelly deficiency. After 30 days, they will fall into a coma. After 60 days, they will die.-->
  <VRE_InsectJellyDependencyHediff.description>此人对虫胶有着基因性化学依赖。如果不定期服用虫胶，其身体将无法维持健康状态，健康与心情都会持续恶化，直至死亡。</VRE_InsectJellyDependencyHediff.description>
  <!--EN: insect jelly dependency-->
  <VRE_InsectJellyDependencyHediff.label>虫胶依赖</VRE_InsectJellyDependencyHediff.label>
  <!--EN: deficiency-->
  <VRE_InsectJellyDependencyHediff.stages.2.label>不足</VRE_InsectJellyDependencyHediff.stages.2.label>
  <!--EN: deficiency coma-->
  <VRE_InsectJellyDependencyHediff.stages.3.overrideLabel>昏迷</VRE_InsectJellyDependencyHediff.stages.3.overrideLabel>
  <!--EN: This person has large jelly sacks present on their lower abdomen, allowing them to periodically produce valuable insect jelly.-->
  <VRE_InsectJellyProduction.description>此人下腹部长有巨大的虫胶囊，可以定期产出宝贵的虫胶。</VRE_InsectJellyProduction.description>
  <!--EN: jelly production-->
  <VRE_InsectJellyProduction.label>虫胶产出</VRE_InsectJellyProduction.label>
  <!--EN: insect mandibles-->
  <VRE_InsectMandibles.comps.0.tools.0.label>昆虫下颌骨</VRE_InsectMandibles.comps.0.tools.0.label>
  <!--EN: Very strong, insect-like mandibles, allowing this person to consume food significantly quicker. They will also be able to use these mandibles in combat if unarmed.-->
  <VRE_InsectMandibles.description>这种基因的携带者长有类似虫族的钳颚。这对咬合力相当出色的钳颚不仅可以大幅提高他们的进食速度，在手无寸铁时还能用来战斗。</VRE_InsectMandibles.description>
  <!--EN: insect mandibles-->
  <VRE_InsectMandibles.label>虫族钳颚</VRE_InsectMandibles.label>
  <!--EN: Low amounts of octopamine cause decreased arousal and activity levels, as well as depression.-->
  <VRE_LowOctopamine.description>这种基因的携带者只能分泌极少量的章胺。这不仅会使他们性欲衰退，还会感到非常抑郁。</VRE_LowOctopamine.description>
  <!--EN: octopamine-down-->
  <VRE_LowOctopamine.label>章胺稀少</VRE_LowOctopamine.label>
  <!--EN: A large cocoon formed by an insector undergoing a metamorphosis. If destroyed, the insector inside will die. After metamorphosis is complete, the insector will emerge from their metapod with a brand new genetic composition.-->
  <VRE_MetapodHediff.description>异虫种为进行变态发育而构造的大型茧。如果将其摧毁，处于内部的异虫种也会随之死亡。当变态发育完成后，异虫种会破茧而出，并形成全新的基因种系。</VRE_MetapodHediff.description>
  <!--EN: metapod-->
  <VRE_MetapodHediff.label>化形茧</VRE_MetapodHediff.label>
  <!--EN: After-effects of undergoing an evolution via a metapod. The insectoid metapod replaces and mutates the genome of the individual. Upon exiting the metapod, the body takes time to restart and rebalance its natural metabolic processes. Duration of the metapod sickness depends on the duration spent in the metapod.-->
  <VRE_MetapodSickness.description>通过变态发育形成全新基因种系所产生的后遗症，身体需要一定的时间来恢复生理机能和平衡新陈代谢过程。在化形茧内部待的越久，后遗症的持续时间也就越长。不会造成长期伤害。</VRE_MetapodSickness.description>
  <!--EN: Metapod sickness-->
  <VRE_MetapodSickness.label>化形茧后遗症</VRE_MetapodSickness.label>
  <!--EN: This person can self-impregnate, creating offspring without a second parent. Specialized reproductive organs generate a fetus internally, which is stored in an ovipositor-like structure until ready to be birthed. It enables carriers to rapidly propagate their species autonomously.-->
  <VRE_Parthenogenesis.description>这种基因的携带者能在不与异性结合的情况下自我受孕。他们会将由生殖器官创造的胎儿储存在与产卵器相似的生物结构中，一直到分娩前为止。</VRE_Parthenogenesis.description>
  <!--EN: parthenogenesis-->
  <VRE_Parthenogenesis.label>孤雌生殖</VRE_Parthenogenesis.label>
  <!--EN: This person has a genetically-induced biochemical dependency on pollution. After 5 days without pollution, carriers will suffer from pollution deficiency. After 30 days, they will fall into a coma. After 60 days, they will die.-->
  <VRE_PollutionDependencyHediff.description>此人对污染有着基因性化学依赖。如果不定期接触污染，其身体将无法维持健康状态，健康与心情都会持续恶化，直至死亡。</VRE_PollutionDependencyHediff.description>
  <!--EN: pollution dependency-->
  <VRE_PollutionDependencyHediff.label>污染依赖</VRE_PollutionDependencyHediff.label>
  <!--EN: deficiency-->
  <VRE_PollutionDependencyHediff.stages.2.label>不足</VRE_PollutionDependencyHediff.stages.2.label>
  <!--EN: deficiency coma-->
  <VRE_PollutionDependencyHediff.stages.3.overrideLabel>昏迷</VRE_PollutionDependencyHediff.stages.3.overrideLabel>
  <!--EN: ripper-blade-->
  <VRE_RipperBlades.comps.0.tools.0.label>裂土刀片</VRE_RipperBlades.comps.0.tools.0.label>
  <!--EN: A long and deadly ripper-blade that greatly lowers work speed, while being able to be used in melee combat to rip even armored enemies in half.-->
  <VRE_RipperBlades.description>这种基因的携带者双手被长长的镰刃所取代。这对如同刀锋般致命的镰刃会降低他们的操作能力，但在战斗中可以轻易地将身着装甲的敌人撕成碎片。</VRE_RipperBlades.description>
  <!--EN: ripper-blade-->
  <VRE_RipperBlades.label>撕裂镰刃</VRE_RipperBlades.label>
  <!--EN: Large amounts of serotonin cause great happiness at the cost of reduced consciousness.-->
  <VRE_Serotonin.description>这种基因的携带者会大量分泌血清素。血清素能使他们沉浸于无穷的极乐中，不过代价则是会降低意识并变得更加好斗。</VRE_Serotonin.description>
  <!--EN: serotonin-buzz-->
  <VRE_Serotonin.label>血清素</VRE_Serotonin.label>
</LanguageData>
